{"version":1,"content":"<html><body><img alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://pro-img-cdn.tvb.com/uploads/image/2026/11/2026FTxWxTqMar1793800865.jpg?x-oss-process=image/resize,w_1200\"/><p>美國中期選舉，在北京，外交部表示是美國內政，中方願繼續同美方加強溝通、妥處分歧、拓展合作。</p><p></p><p>外交部發言人毛寧表示：「中期選舉是美國內政，中方願繼續同美方一道維護好、落實好兩國元首重要共識，加強溝通，妥處分歧、拓展合作，構建基於尊重、公平、對等的中美建設性戰略穩定關係。」</p></body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-11-04T15:05:40.477719+00:00","quality":{"score":0,"chars":135,"images":1,"source":"TVB 新聞","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-11-04T14:10:00+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-04T15:38:29.539853+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-04T14:58:26.761315+00:00","content_hash":"bb5f24b63281c698bf9b92ea7c7f52d9a33affa2d5b02441564ae89b661da034","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}